---
// Required on every page while the models are fictional (AGENTS.md). Identical everywhere; never edited (voice skill).
---
<div class="notice" role="note" aria-label="Notice">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag">Notice</span>
    <p>Every model listed here is fictional and nothing can be run yet. Prices are planned. The waitlist is the only part that works.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .notice { background: var(--redact); color: var(--paper); font-size: var(--fs-xs); }
  .notice .wrap { display: flex; gap: var(--s2); align-items: center; padding-block: var(--s1); }
  .notice p { margin: 0; max-width: none; }
  .notice .tag { border-color: var(--action); color: var(--action); flex: none; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .notice .tag { display: none; } }
</style>
